msgstr "1. Plan"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/demo-design.md:9
msgid "1.1 武器与技能"
msgstr "1.1 Weapons and Skills"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/demo-design.md:11
msgid "&emsp;&emsp;3种武器：剑盾、⼤锤、⼸箭。   &emsp;&emsp;每种武器有2个技能。所有武器都可以跳跃、防御。"
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;3 weapons: Sword & Shield, Great Hammer, Bow.   "
"&emsp;&emsp;Each weapon has 2 skills. All weapons can jump and defend."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/demo-design.md:14
#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/demo-design.md:37
msgid "剑盾"
msgstr "Sword & Shield"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/demo-design.md:16
msgid ""
"&emsp;&emsp;技能1 - 劈砍：攻击速度快，低伤害，距离近。特殊效果：连击 - "
"每次劈砍⼏种敌⼈产⽣1点连击，持续较短时间，每点连击增加10%劈砍的伤害；若⾃⾝受到未被防御的伤害，则取消所有连击。   "
"&emsp;&emsp;技能2 - 盾击：攻击速度快，极低伤害，距离近。特殊效果：盾击动作的前⼀半时间附带防御效果。   "
"&emsp;&emsp;防御：减少60%伤害。   &emsp;&emsp;跳跃：略。"
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;Skill 1 - Slash: Fast attack speed, low damage, close range. "
"Special Effect: Combo - each slash on an enemy generates 1 combo point, "
"lasting a short duration; each combo point increases slash damage by 10%."
" If the character takes unblocked damage, all combo points are lost.   "
"&emsp;&emsp;Skill 2 - Shield Bash: Fast attack speed, very low damage, "
"close range. Special Effect: The first half of the shield bash animation "
"includes a blocking effect.   &emsp;&emsp;Defense: Reduces damage by 60%."
"   &emsp;&emsp;Jump: Omitted."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/demo-design.md:21
#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/demo-design.md:54
msgid "⼤锤"
msgstr "Great Hammer"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/demo-design.md:23
msgid ""
"&emsp;&emsp;技能1 - 锤击：攻击速度中，中伤害，距离中。   &emsp;&emsp;技能2 - "
"锤击plus：攻击速度慢，⾼伤害，距离中。特殊效果：给予对⽅易伤，持续较短时间，易伤时间伤害加倍。   "
"&emsp;&emsp;防御：减少80%伤害。   &emsp;&emsp;跳跃：略。"
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;Skill 1 - Hammer Strike: Medium attack speed, medium damage, "
"medium range.   &emsp;&emsp;Skill 2 - Hammer Strike Plus: Slow attack "
"speed, high damage, medium range. Special Effect: Applies Vulnerability "
"to the target, lasting a short duration; damage is doubled during "
"Vulnerability.   &emsp;&emsp;Defense: Reduces damage by 80%.   "
"&emsp;&emsp;Jump: Omitted."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/demo-design.md:28
#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/demo-design.md:70
msgid "⼸箭"
msgstr "Bow"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/demo-design.md:30
msgid ""
"&emsp;&emsp;技能1 - 射击：攻击速度中，低伤害，距离远。   &emsp;&emsp;技能2 - "
"射击plus：攻击速度慢，中伤害，距离极远。   &emsp;&emsp;防御：减少20%伤害。   &emsp;&emsp;跳跃：略。"
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;Skill 1 - Shoot: Medium attack speed, low damage, long range."
"   &emsp;&emsp;Skill 2 - Shoot Plus: Slow attack speed, medium damage, "
"very long range.   &emsp;&emsp;Defense: Reduces damage by 20%.   "
"&emsp;&emsp;Jump: Omitted."

