"   &emsp;&emsp;Battlefield size."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/demo-design.md:89
msgid "1.2 关卡"
msgstr "1.2 Levels"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/demo-design.md:91
msgid "&emsp;&emsp;玩家有3个⼩⼈，3种武器各1个。"
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;The player has 3 characters, each with one of the 3 weapon "
"types."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/demo-design.md:92
msgid ""
"第⼀关：   &emsp;&emsp;训练时，敌⼈的武器是剑盾、⼤锤、⼸箭中任意⼀个，需要为这个敌⼈编写简单的战⽃AI。   "
"&emsp;&emsp;战⽃时，敌⼈与训练时相同，但具备1.5倍的⾎量、1.5倍的伤害。   "
"&emsp;&emsp;玩家选择任意1个⼩⼈携带任意武器战⽃。"
msgstr ""
"Level 1:   &emsp;&emsp;During training, the enemy's weapon is one of "
"Sword & Shield, Great Hammer, or Bow; a simple battle AI needs to be "
"written for this enemy.   &emsp;&emsp;During battle, the enemy is the "
"same as in training but with 1.5x HP and 1.5x damage.   &emsp;&emsp;The "
"player selects any 1 character carrying any weapon to fight."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/demo-design.md:96
msgid ""
"第⼆关：   &emsp;&emsp;训练时，有2个敌⼈可选，A.第⼀关的敌⼈，B. 玩家通过第⼀关的⼩⼈。   "
"&emsp;&emsp;战⽃时，训练中的2个敌⼈都上场，并且的⾎量和伤害是训练时1.5倍。   "
"&emsp;&emsp;玩家选择任意2个⼩⼈携带2个不重复的武器战⽃。"
msgstr ""
"Level 2:   &emsp;&emsp;During training, there are 2 enemies to choose "
"from: A. the Level 1 enemy, B. the player's character that cleared Level "
"1.   &emsp;&emsp;During battle, both training enemies appear, with HP and"
" damage at 1.5x their training values.   &emsp;&emsp;The player selects "
"any 2 characters carrying 2 non-duplicate weapons to fight."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/demo-design.md:100
msgid ""
"第三关：   &emsp;&emsp;训练时，有3个敌⼈可选，玩家通过第⼀关的⼩⼈，玩家通过第⼆关的⼩⼈1，玩家通过第⼆关的⼩⼈2。   "
"&emsp;&emsp;战⽃时，训练中的3个敌⼈都上场，并且的⾎量和伤害是训练时1.5倍。   "
"&emsp;&emsp;玩家的3个⼩⼈携带3种武器战⽃。"
msgstr ""
"Level 3:   &emsp;&emsp;During training, there are 3 enemies to choose "
"from: the player's character that cleared Level 1, the player's character"
" 1 that cleared Level 2, and the player's character 2 that cleared Level "
"2.   &emsp;&emsp;During battle, all 3 training enemies appear, with HP "
"and damage at 1.5x their training values.   &emsp;&emsp;The player's 3 "
"characters carry the 3 weapon types to fight."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/demo-design.md:105
msgid "1.3 决策树接⼝"
msgstr "1.3 Decision Tree Interface"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/demo-design.md:107
msgid ""
"&emsp;&emsp;在决策树部分，暴露⼀些接⼝，让我们可以尝试⽤调整决策树的⽣成⽅式。   "
"&emsp;&emsp;最简单的⽅式是，决策树的条件（training_input的不同列）可以增减。"
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;In the decision tree section, expose some interfaces so we "
"can try adjusting the decision tree generation method.   &emsp;&emsp;The "
"simplest approach is that the conditions of the decision tree (different "
"columns of training_input) can be added or removed."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/demo-design.md:110
msgid "1.4 ⾎条显⽰"
msgstr "1.4 HP Bar Display"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/demo-design.md:112
msgid "&emsp;&emsp;增加⾎条、伤害的显⽰。"
msgstr "&emsp;&emsp;Add HP bar and damage display."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/demo-design.md:114
msgid "2.⽅案解释"
msgstr "2. Plan Explanation"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/demo-design.md:116
msgid ""
"&emsp;&emsp;也许，⽅案最好不要解释，这样看⽅案的⼈更容易独⽴地评判⽅案的好坏。   "
"&emsp;&emsp;如果你也这么觉得，就先不看后⾯的解释，评判⼀下这个⽅案。"
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;Perhaps the plan should not be explained, so that readers can"
" more easily judge the plan's merits independently.   &emsp;&emsp;If you "
"agree, skip the following explanation and evaluate this plan first."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/demo-design.md:119
msgid "&emsp;&emsp;我还是想做⼀些解释说明。"
msgstr "&emsp;&emsp;I still want to provide some explanations."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/demo-design.md:121
#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/demo-design.md:133
#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/demo-design.md:137
msgid "&emsp;&emsp;-"
msgstr "&emsp;&emsp;-"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/demo-design.md:123
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"&emsp;&emsp;“1.1 武器与技能”和“1.2 "
"关卡”主要是为了回答核⼼玩法的问题。我也想不清楚，但我们⼤概也只有通过制作才能逐渐清楚。所以在现有的条件下，尽可能给出⼀个答案即可。   "
"&emsp;&emsp;之前的⽂档中，和核⼼玩法有关的，有3个："
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;\"1.1 Weapons and Skills\" and \"1.2 Levels\" primarily "
"address the question of core gameplay. I'm not entirely clear about it "
"either, but we probably can only become clearer through development. So "
"under the current conditions, providing the best possible answer is "
"sufficient.   &emsp;&emsp;Among previous documents, 3 are related to core"
" gameplay:"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/demo-design.md:126
msgid ""
"&emsp;&emsp;[《⻆⾊和招式》](char-skill.md)   &emsp;&emsp;[《战⽃体验》](battle-"
"experience.md)   &emsp;&emsp;[《有关 AI 训练的三个想法》](3-ml-thoughts.md)"
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;[\"Characters and Skills\"](char-skill.md)   "
"&emsp;&emsp;[\"Battle Experience\"](battle-experience.md)   "
"&emsp;&emsp;[\"Three Thoughts on AI Training\"](3-ml-thoughts.md)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/demo-design.md:130
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"&emsp;&emsp;我选择了较稳妥的⽅案 —— “战⽃体验”中4个颜⾊的⽅案，我不容易想象；“有关 AI "
"训练的三个想法”中的⽅案，有挺多不确定；“⻆⾊和招式”的⽅案，⽐较平实⼀些。所以，我在“⻆⾊和招式”的基础上，去掉⼀些我不清楚的、加⼊点我的想法，形成了现在的⽅案。"
"   &emsp;&emsp;之前的玩法所⽋缺的，也许可以描述为差别和挑战。核⼼玩法，都为解决这个。"
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;I chose the more conservative plan — the 4-color plan in "
"\"Battle Experience\" is hard for me to imagine; the plan in \"Three "
"Thoughts on AI Training\" has many uncertainties; the \"Characters and "
"Skills\" plan is relatively straightforward. So, based on \"Characters "
"and Skills\", I removed parts I wasn't sure about and added some of my "
"own ideas to form the current plan.   &emsp;&emsp;What was lacking in the"
" previous gameplay might be described as differentiation and challenge. "
"The core gameplay is all about solving this."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/demo-design.md:135
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"&emsp;&emsp;“1.3 决策树接⼝”。我觉得，需要去更多地了解机器学习的原理和效果，所以就加⼊了这个部分。其实它和“有关 AI "
"训练的三个想法”中“2. 不同的性格”是⼀码事。不过，这回没有说去实现什么效果，只是让我们能够⽐较⽅便地试⼀试。"
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;\"1.3 Decision Tree Interface\". I felt the need to better "
"understand the principles and effects of machine learning, so I added "
"this section. In fact, it's the same thing as \"2. Different "
"Personalities\" in \"Three Thoughts on AI Training\". However, this time "
"the goal isn't to implement any specific effect, but simply to let us "
"experiment more conveniently."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/demo-design.md:139
msgid "&emsp;&emsp;“1.4.⾎条显⽰”是解决游戏中反馈的⼀个缺陷。"
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;\"1.4 HP Bar Display\" addresses a feedback deficiency in the"
" game."

